(10, 'ডিলার এগ্রিমেন্ট পেপার', 'dilar-egriment-pepar', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\ntext-align:center;line-height:normal\"><b><u><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN\">ডিলার</span></u></b><u><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN;\r\nmso-bidi-font-weight:bold\"> <b>নিয়োগের</b> <b>চুক্তিপত্র<o:p></o:p></b></span></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\r\ntext-align:center;line-height:normal\"><u><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">&nbsp;</span></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:1.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:15.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:\r\nBN;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">ব্যবস্থাপনা<b>\r\n</b>পরিচালক</span><b><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN\">, </span></b><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN;\r\nmso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">ম্যাটসন<b> </b>ডিস্ট্রিবিউশন<b> </b>লিমিটেড</span><b><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:\r\nBN\">, </span></b><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;\r\nmso-bidi-language:BN;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">২১</span><b><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:\r\nBN\">/</span></b><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;\r\nmso-bidi-language:BN;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">এ</span><b><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:\r\nBN\">, </span></b><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;\r\nmso-bidi-language:BN;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">রোড</span><b><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:\r\nBN\">-</span></b><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;\r\nmso-bidi-language:BN;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">২</span><b><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:\r\nBN\">, </span></b><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;\r\nmso-bidi-language:BN;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">ব্লক</span><b><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:\r\nBN\">-</span></b><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;\r\nmso-bidi-language:BN;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">এ</span><b><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:\r\nBN\">, </span></b><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;\r\nmso-bidi-language:BN;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">৩য়<b> </b>তলা</span><b><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN\">, </span></b><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN;\r\nmso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">আফতাবনগর</span><b><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN\">, </span></b><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN;\r\nmso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">বাড্ডা</span><b><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN\">, </span></b><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN;\r\nmso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">ঢাকা</span><b><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN\">-</span></b><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:BN;\r\nmso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">১২১২</span><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;\r\nfont-family:Bangla;mso-bidi-language:HI;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold\">।</span><b><span lang=\"HI\" style=\"