(2, 'এরিয়া সেলস ম্যানেজার(এএসএম) পদে নিয়োগ', '<h4 class=\"text-lg mb-2 font-bold\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:Bangla;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#050505;\r\nmso-bidi-language:BN\">নিয়োগ বিজ্ঞপ্তি&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:Bangla;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#050505\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:\r\n16.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#050505;\r\nmso-bidi-language:BN\">শুধুমাত্র ম্যাটসন ব্রান্ডের </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#050505;mso-bidi-language:BN\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\nBangla;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#050505;mso-bidi-language:\r\nBN\">টিভি</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#050505\">, </span><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:Bangla;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#050505;\r\nmso-bidi-language:BN\">ফ্রিজ</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\nBangla;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#050505\">, </span><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#050505;mso-bidi-language:BN\">এসি এবং হোমএপ্লায়েন্স\r\nইলেক্ট্রিক এন্ড ইলেক্ট্রিনিক্স প্রোডাক্ট বাজারজাত করার লক্ষে বিভিন্ন পদে দক্ষ\r\nবিক্রয় প্রতিনিধি আবশ্যক। </span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:Bangla;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#050505;mso-bidi-language:BN\">সংশ্লিষ্ট\r\nপ্রোডাক্টে ডিলার তৈরী ও সেলস এর অভিজ্ঞ লোক ব্যতিত সিভি নিস্প্রয়োজন।<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:Bangla;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#050505\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:Bangla;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#050505\">পদের নাম:</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:Bangla;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&q